#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:5
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "隐私政策"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:7
msgid "Effective date: **February 21, 2023**"
msgstr "生效日期：**2023 年 2 月 21 日**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:9
msgid ""
"Welcome to Read the Docs. At Read the Docs, we believe in protecting the "
"privacy of our users, authors, and readers."
msgstr "欢迎使用 Read the Docs。在 Read the Docs，我们相信应保护用户、作者和读者的隐私。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:15
msgid "The short version"
msgstr "简要版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:17
msgid ""
"We collect your information only with your consent; we only collect the "
"minimum amount of personal information that is necessary to fulfill the "
"purpose of your interaction with us; we don't sell it to third parties; and "
"we only use it as this Privacy Policy describes."
msgstr "我们仅在你同意时收集你的信息；只收集实现你与我们交互目的所必需的最少个人信息；不出售给第三方；并且只按本隐私政策所述使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:23
msgid ""
"Of course, the short version doesn't tell you everything, so please read on "
"for more details!"
msgstr "当然，简明版本无法涵盖全部内容，请继续阅读以了解详细信息！"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:28
msgid "Our services"
msgstr "我们的服务"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:30
msgid "Read the Docs is made up of:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 由以下部分组成："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:32
msgid "readthedocs.org (\"Read the Docs Community\")"
msgstr "readthedocs.org（\"Read the Docs Community\"）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:33
msgid ""
"This is a website aimed at documentation authors and project maintainers "
"writing and distributing technical documentation. This Privacy Policy "
"applies to this site in full without reservation."
msgstr "这是面向编写和分发技术文档的文档作者与项目维护者的网站。本隐私政策完全适用于该站点，无任何保留。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:37
msgid "readthedocs.com (\"Read the Docs Business\")"
msgstr "readthedocs.com（\"Read the Docs Business\"）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:38
msgid ""
"This website is a commercial hosted offering for hosting private "
"documentation for corporate clients. This Privacy Policy applies to this "
"site in full without reservation."
msgstr "这是面向企业客户托管私有文档的商业托管服务。本隐私政策完全适用于该站点，无任何保留。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:42
msgid ""
"readthedocs.io, readthedocs-hosted.com, and other domains (\"Documentation "
"Sites\")"
msgstr "readthedocs.io、readthedocs-hosted.com 及其他域名（\"文档站点\"）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:43
msgid ""
"These websites are where Read the Docs hosts documentation (`User-Generated "
"Content <https://about.readthedocs.com/terms-of-service/#user-generated-"
"content>`_) on behalf of documentation authors. A best effort is made to "
"apply this Privacy Policy to these sites but the documentation may contain "
"content and files created by documentation authors."
msgstr ""
"这些网站是 Read the Docs 代文档作者托管文档（`用户生成内容 <https://about.readthedocs.com/terms-"
"of-service/#user-generated-content>`_ "
"）的地方。我们尽力将本隐私政策应用于这些站点，但文档中可能包含由文档作者创建的内容和文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:49
msgid ""
"All use of Read the Docs is subject to this Privacy Policy, together with "
"our `Terms of Service <https://about.readthedocs.com/terms-of-service/>`_."
msgstr ""
"对 Read the Docs 的所有使用均受本隐私政策和我们的 `服务条款 <https://about.readthedocs.com/terms-"
"of-service/>`_ 约束。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:53
msgid "What information Read the Docs collects and why"
msgstr "Read the Docs 收集哪些信息及原因"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:56
msgid "Information from website browsers"
msgstr "来自网站浏览器的信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:58
msgid ""
"If you're **just browsing the website**, we collect the same basic "
"information that most websites collect. We use common internet technologies,"
" such as cookies and web server logs. We collect this basic information from"
" everybody, whether they have an account or not."
msgstr ""
"若你**只是浏览网站** ，我们收集的信息与大多数网站相同。我们使用常见的互联网技术，如 cookie 和 Web "
"服务器日志。无论访客是否有账户，我们都收集这些基本信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:62
msgid "The information we collect about all visitors to our website includes:"
msgstr "我们收集的所有网站访客信息包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:64
msgid "the visitor's browser type"
msgstr "访客的浏览器类型"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:65
msgid "language preference"
msgstr "语言偏好"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:66
msgid "referring site"
msgstr "来源站点"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:67
msgid "the date and time of each visitor request"
msgstr "每次访客请求的日期和时间"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:69
msgid ""
"We also collect potentially personally-identifying information like Internet"
" Protocol (IP) addresses."
msgstr "我们还收集可能具有个人识别性的信息，如互联网协议（IP）地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:74
msgid "Why do we collect this?"
msgstr "我们为何收集这些信息？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:76
msgid ""
"We collect this information to better understand how our website visitors "
"use Read the Docs, and to monitor and protect the security of the website."
msgstr "我们收集这些信息以更好地了解网站访客如何使用 Read the Docs，并监控和保护网站安全。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:81
msgid "Information from users with accounts"
msgstr "来自有账户用户的信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:83
msgid ""
"If you **create an account**, we require some basic information at the time "
"of account creation. You will create your own user name and password, and we"
" will ask you for a valid email account. You also have the option to give us"
" more information if you want to, and this may include \"User Personal "
"Information.\""
msgstr ""
"若你**创建账户** "
"，我们在创建账户时需要一些基本信息。你会自行设置用户名和密码，我们还会要求你提供有效的邮箱账户。你也可以选择向我们提供更多信息，这些信息可能包含\"用户个人信息\"。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:88
msgid ""
"\"User Personal Information\" is any information about one of our users "
"which could, alone or together with other information, personally identify "
"him or her. Information such as a user name and password, an email address, "
"a real name, and a photograph are examples of \"User Personal Information.\""
msgstr "\"用户个人信息\"是指关于我们某位用户的、单独或与其他信息结合后可识别其身份的任何信息。用户姓名和密码、邮箱地址、真实姓名和照片等都属于\"用户个人信息\"。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:93
msgid ""
"User Personal Information does not include aggregated, non-personally "
"identifying information. We may use aggregated, non-personally identifying "
"information to operate, improve, and optimize our website and service."
msgstr "用户个人信息不包括聚合的、不可识别个人身份的信息。我们可能使用聚合的、不可识别个人身份的信息来运营、改进和优化我们的网站与服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:98
msgid "Why do we collect this information?"
msgstr "我们为何收集这些信息？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:100
msgid ""
"We need your User Personal Information to create your account, and to "
"provide the services you request."
msgstr "我们需要你的用户个人信息来创建账户并提供你请求的服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:101
msgid ""
"We use your User Personal Information, specifically your user name, to "
"identify you on Read the Docs."
msgstr "我们使用你的用户个人信息（具体而言是你的用户名）在 Read the Docs 上识别你的身份。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:102
msgid "We use it to fill out your profile and share that profile with other users."
msgstr "我们用它填写你的资料，并将该资料与其他用户分享。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:103
msgid ""
"We will use your email address to communicate with you but it is not shared "
"publicly."
msgstr "我们使用你的邮箱与你沟通，但不会公开分享。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:104
msgid ""
"We limit our use of your User Personal Information to the purposes listed in"
" this Privacy Statement. If we need to use your User Personal Information "
"for other purposes, we will ask your permission first. You can always see "
"what information we have in your `user account "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/edit/>`__."
msgstr ""
"我们将用户个人信息的使用限于本隐私声明所列目的。若需用于其他目的，我们会先征得你的许可。你随时可以在 `用户账户 "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/edit/>`__ 中查看我们掌握的信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:110
msgid "What information Read the Docs does not collect"
msgstr "Read the Docs 不收集哪些信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:112
msgid ""
"We do not intentionally collect **sensitive personal information**, such as "
"social security numbers, genetic data, health information, or religious "
"information."
msgstr "我们不会有意收集**敏感个人信息** ，如社会保障号码、基因数据、健康信息或宗教信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:115
msgid ""
"Documentation Sites hosted on Read the Docs are public, anyone (including "
"us) may view their contents. If you have included private or sensitive "
"information in your Documentation Site, such as email addresses, that "
"information may be indexed by search engines or used by third parties."
msgstr ""
"托管在 Read the Docs "
"上的文档站点是公开的，任何人（包括我们）都可能查看其内容。若你在文档站点中放入了私密或敏感信息（如邮箱地址），这些信息可能被搜索引擎索引或被第三方使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:120
msgid ""
"Read the Docs Business may host `private projects "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/terms-of-service/#private-projects>`_ which "
"we treat as confidential and we only access them for support reasons, with "
"your consent, or if required to for security reasons"
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs Business 可能托管 `私有项目 <https://about.readthedocs.com/terms-of-"
"service/#private-projects>`_ ，我们将其视为机密，仅出于支持目的、经你同意或因安全原因需要时才予访问"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:123
msgid ""
"If you're a **child under the age of 13**, you may not have an account on "
"Read the Docs. Read the Docs does not knowingly collect information from or "
"direct any of our content specifically to children under 13. If we learn or "
"have reason to suspect that you are a user who is under the age of 13, we "
"will unfortunately have to close your account. We don't want to discourage "
"you from writing software documentation, but those are the rules."
msgstr ""
"若你是**未满 13 周岁的儿童** ，你可能无法在 Read the Docs 上拥有账户。Read the Docs 不会 knowingly "
"地收集 13 岁以下儿童的信息，也不会专门向他们投放任何内容。若我们得知或有理由怀疑你是未满 13 "
"周岁的用户，将不得不关闭你的账户。我们不希望打击你编写软件文档的积极性，但规则就是规则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:129
msgid "How we share the information we collect"
msgstr "我们如何分享收集的信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:131
msgid ""
"We **do not** share, sell, rent, or trade User Personal Information with "
"third parties for their commercial purposes."
msgstr "我们**不会** 出于第三方的商业目的共享、出售、出租或交易用户个人信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:134
msgid ""
"We do not disclose User Personal Information outside Read the Docs, except "
"in the situations listed in this section or in the section below on "
"compelled disclosure."
msgstr "除本节所列情形或下文强制披露一节所列情形外，我们不会在 Read the Docs 之外披露用户个人信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:138
msgid ""
"We **do** share certain aggregated, non-personally identifying information "
"with others about how our users, collectively, use Read the Docs. For "
"example, we may compile statistics on the prevalence of different types of "
"documentation across Read the Docs for a blog post or popularity of "
"programming languages for advertising partners."
msgstr ""
"我们**确实** 会与他人分享某些聚合的、不可识别个人身份的信息，说明我们的用户整体上如何使用 Read the Docs。例如，我们可能汇总统计 "
"Read the Docs 上各类文档的普及程度用于博客文章，或统计编程语言的流行度供广告合作方参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:144
msgid ""
"We **do** host advertising on Documentation Sites. This advertising is "
"first-party advertising hosted by Read the Docs. We **do not** run any code "
"from advertisers and all ad images are hosted on Read the Docs' servers. For"
" more details, see our document on :doc:`advertising/advertising-details`."
msgstr ""
"我们**确实** 在文档站点上投放广告。这些是由 Read the Docs 托管的第一方广告。我们**不会** "
"运行广告主的任何代码，所有广告图片都托管在 Read the Docs 的服务器上。更多细节见我们的 :doc:`advertising"
"/advertising-details` 文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:150
msgid ""
"We may use User Personal Information with your permission, so we can perform"
" services you have requested. For example, if you request service on "
"commercially hosted docs, we will ask your permission to sync your private "
"repositories."
msgstr "经你许可，我们可能使用用户个人信息以执行你请求的服务。例如，若你请求商业托管文档的服务，我们会征得你同意以同步你的私有仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:155
msgid ""
"We may share User Personal Information with a limited number of third party "
"vendors who process it on our behalf to provide or improve our service, and "
"who have agreed to privacy restrictions similar to our own Privacy "
"Statement. For more details, see our next section on :ref:`third parties "
"<privacy-policy:Third party vendors>`."
msgstr ""
"我们可能与数量有限的第三方供应商共享用户个人信息，由其代表我们处理以提供或改进服务，且它们已同意遵守与我们隐私声明类似的隐私限制。更多细节见下一节 "
":ref:`第三方供应商 <privacy-policy:Third party vendors>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:162
msgid "Third party vendors"
msgstr "第三方供应商"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:164
msgid ""
"As we mentioned, we may share some information with third party vendors or "
"it may be collected by them on our behalf. The information collected and "
"stored by third parties is subject to their policies and practices. This "
"list will be updated from time to time and we encourage you to check back "
"periodically."
msgstr "如前所述，我们可能与第三方供应商共享部分信息，或由其代我们收集。第三方收集和存储的信息受其自身政策和实践约束。此列表会不时更新，我们建议你定期回看。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:172
msgid "Payment processing"
msgstr "支付处理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:174
msgid ""
"Should you choose to become a `Supporter`_, purchase a `Gold membership`_, "
"or become a subscriber to Read the Docs' commercial hosting product, your "
"payment information and details will be processed by Stripe. Read the Docs "
"does not store your payment information."
msgstr ""
"若你选择成为 `Supporter`_ 、购买 `Gold membership`_ 或订阅 Read the Docs "
"的商业托管产品，你的支付信息和详情将由 Stripe 处理。Read the Docs 不存储你的支付信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:183
msgid "Site monitoring"
msgstr "站点监控"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:185
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses Sentry and New Relic to diagnose errors and improve the "
"performance of our site. Both companies take part in the EU-US Privacy "
"Shield framework. We aim to minimize the amount of personal information "
"shared, but the information may include your IP address."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 使用 Sentry 和 New Relic 诊断错误并改进站点性能。两家公司均参与 EU-US Privacy Shield"
" 框架。我们力求最小化共享的个人信息量，但这些信息可能包含你的 IP 地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:192
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:194
msgid ""
"We go into detail on analytics in a :ref:`separate section specific to "
"analytics <privacy-policy:Plausible>`."
msgstr "我们在 :ref:`专门针对分析的独立章节 <privacy-policy:Plausible>` 中详细介绍分析相关内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:198
msgid "Support desk"
msgstr "支持工单系统"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:200
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses Front to manage support requests. If you request support "
"-- typically via email -- Front may process your contact information."
msgstr "Read the Docs 使用 Front 管理支持请求。若你请求支持——通常通过邮件——Front 可能处理你的联系信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:205
msgid "Email newsletter"
msgstr "邮件通讯"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:207
msgid ""
"If you sign up for the Read the Docs email newsletter, your email address "
"and name will be stored by MailerLite. This newsletter is separate from "
"creating a Read the Docs account and signing up for Read the Docs does not "
"opt you in for the newsletter."
msgstr ""
"若你订阅 Read the Docs 邮件通讯，你的邮箱地址和姓名将由 MailerLite 存储。该通讯与创建 Read the Docs "
"账户相互独立，订阅 Read the Docs 不会自动为你订阅该通讯。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:212
msgid ""
"You can manage your email subscription including unsubscribing and deleting "
"your records with MailerLite. There is a link to do so in the footer of any "
"newsletter you receive from us."
msgstr "你可以通过 MailerLite 管理邮件订阅，包括退订和删除你的记录。我们发送的每封通讯页脚都提供相应链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:217
msgid "Public information on Read the Docs"
msgstr "Read the Docs 上的公开信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:219
msgid ""
"Most of Read the Docs is public-facing including user names, project names, "
"and Documentation Sites. If your content is public-facing, third parties may"
" access it. We do not sell that content; it is yours."
msgstr "Read the Docs 大部分内容面向公众，包括用户名、项目名称和文档站点。若你的内容面向公众，第三方可能访问。我们不出售这些内容；它属于你。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:226
msgid "Our use of cookies and tracking"
msgstr "我们对 cookie 和追踪的使用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:230
msgid "Do Not Track"
msgstr "Do Not Track"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:232
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports Do Not Track (DNT) and respects users' tracking "
"preferences. Specifically, we support the `W3C's tracking preference "
"expression`_ and the `EFF's DNT Policy`_."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 支持 Do Not Track（DNT）并尊重用户的追踪偏好。具体而言，我们支持 `W3C's tracking "
"preference expression`_ 和 `EFF's DNT Policy`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:236
msgid "For Read the Docs, this means:"
msgstr "对 Read the Docs 而言，这意味着："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:238
msgid "We **do not** do behavioral ad targeting regardless of your DNT preference."
msgstr "无论你的 DNT 偏好如何，我们**都不会** 进行行为广告定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:239
msgid ""
"Regardless of DNT preference, our logs that contain IP addresses and user "
"agent strings are deleted after 10 days unless a DNT exception applies."
msgstr "无论 DNT 偏好如何，除非适用 DNT 例外情况，含 IP 地址和 user agent 字符串的日志都会在 10 天后删除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:241
msgid "Our full DNT policy is `available here`_."
msgstr "我们的完整 DNT 政策 `available here`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:243
msgid ""
"Our DNT policy applies without reservation to Read the Docs Community and "
"Read the Docs Business. A best effort is made to apply this to Documentation"
" Sites, but we do not have complete control over the contents of these "
"sites."
msgstr ""
"我们的 DNT 政策完全适用于 Read the Docs Community 和 Read the Docs "
"Business。我们尽力将其应用于文档站点，但对这些站点的内容没有完全控制权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:248
msgid "For more details about DNT, visit `All About Do Not Track`_."
msgstr "有关 DNT 的更多细节，请访问 `All About Do Not Track`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:252
msgid ""
"Due to the nature of our environment where documentation is built as "
"necessary, the DNT analytics opt-out for Documentation Sites only applies "
"for those sites generated after May 1, 2018."
msgstr "由于我们的环境按需构建文档，文档站点的 DNT 分析退出选项仅适用于 2018 年 5 月 1 日之后生成的站点。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:262
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookie"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:264
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses cookies to make interactions with our service easy and "
"meaningful. We use cookies to keep you logged in, remember your preferences,"
" and provide information for future development of Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 使用 cookie 让与我们的服务交互变得便捷且有意义。我们用 cookie 保持你的登录状态、记住你的偏好，并为 Read"
" the Docs 的后续发展提供信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:268
msgid ""
"A cookie is a small piece of text that our web server stores on your "
"computer or mobile device, which your browser sends to us when you return to"
" our site. Cookies do not necessarily identify you if you are merely "
"visiting Read the Docs; however, a cookie may store a unique identifier for "
"each logged in user. The cookies Read the Docs sets are essential for the "
"operation of the website, or are used for performance or functionality. By "
"using our website, you agree that we can place these types of cookies on "
"your computer or device. If you disable your browser or device's ability to "
"accept cookies, you will not be able to log in to Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"Cookie 是我们的 Web 服务器存储在你电脑或移动设备上的一小段文本，当你返回本站时浏览器会将其发送给我们。若你只是访问 Read the "
"Docs，Cookie 未必能识别你的身份；但它可能为每个已登录用户存储唯一标识符。Read the Docs 设置的 Cookie "
"对网站运行必不可少，或用于性能和功能。使用我们的网站即表示你同意我们在你的电脑或设备上放置这类 Cookie。若禁用浏览器或设备的 Cookie "
"接收能力，你将无法登录 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:279
msgid "Plausible"
msgstr "Plausible"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:281
msgid ""
"We use Plausible as a third party analytics service, but we don't use it to "
"track you individually or collect your User Personal Information. We use "
"Plausible to collect information about how our website performs and how our "
"users, in general, navigate through and use Read the Docs. This helps us "
"evaluate our users' use of Read the Docs; compile statistical reports on "
"activity; and improve our content and website performance."
msgstr ""
"我们将 Plausible 用作第三方分析服务，但不用它对你进行个体追踪或收集用户个人信息。我们使用 Plausible "
"收集网站表现以及用户整体如何浏览和使用 Read the Docs 的信息。这有助于我们评估用户的使用情况、编制活动统计报告，并改进内容和网站性能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:288
msgid ""
"Plausible gathers certain simple, non-personally identifying information "
"over time, such as browser type, internet service provider, referring and "
"exit pages, time stamp, and similar data about your use of Read the Docs. We"
" do not link this information to any of your personal information such as "
"your user name."
msgstr ""
"Plausible 会随时间收集某些简单且不可识别个人身份的信息，如浏览器类型、互联网服务提供商、来源页和退出页、时间戳，以及你使用 Read the "
"Docs 的类似数据。我们不会将这些信息与你的任何个人信息（如用户名）关联。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:293
msgid ""
"Read the Docs will not, nor will we allow any third party to, use the "
"Plausible tool to track our users individually or collect any User Personal "
"Information."
msgstr "Read the Docs 不会、也不会允许任何第三方使用 Plausible 工具对我们的用户进行个体追踪或收集任何用户个人信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:298
msgid "How Read the Docs secures your information"
msgstr "Read the Docs 如何保护你的信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:300
msgid ""
"Read the Docs takes all measures reasonably necessary to protect User "
"Personal Information from unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction; "
"maintain data accuracy; and help ensure the appropriate use of User Personal"
" Information. We follow generally accepted industry standards to protect the"
" personal information submitted to us, both during transmission and once we "
"receive it."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs "
"采取一切合理必要的措施，防止用户个人信息被未授权访问、篡改或破坏；维护数据准确性；并帮助确保用户个人信息被恰当使用。我们遵循业界公认的标准保护提交给我们的个人信息，无论传输过程中还是接收之后。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:306
#, python-format
msgid ""
"No method of transmission, or method of electronic storage, is 100% secure. "
"Therefore, we cannot guarantee its absolute security."
msgstr "没有任何传输方式或电子存储方式是 100% 安全的。因此我们无法保证其绝对安全。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:311
msgid "Read the Docs' global privacy practices"
msgstr "Read the Docs 的全球隐私实践"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:313
msgid ""
"**Information that we collect will be stored and processed in the United "
"States** in accordance with this Privacy Policy. However, we understand that"
" we have users from different countries and regions with different privacy "
"expectations, and we try to meet those needs."
msgstr "**我们收集的信息将依照本隐私政策在美国存储和处理** 。但我们理解来自不同国家和地区、隐私期待各异的用户群体，并努力满足这些需求。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:319
msgid ""
"We provide the same standard of privacy protection to all our users around "
"the world, regardless of their country of origin or location, Additionally, "
"we require that if our vendors or affiliates have access to User Personal "
"Information, they must comply with our privacy policies and with applicable "
"data privacy laws."
msgstr "我们为全球所有用户提供同等标准的隐私保护，无论其来源国家或所在地。此外，我们要求供应商或关联方若能访问用户个人信息，必须遵守我们的隐私政策和适用的数据隐私法律。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:325
msgid "In particular:"
msgstr "具体而言："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:327
msgid ""
"Read the Docs provides clear methods of unambiguous, informed consent at the"
" time of data collection, when we do collect your personal data."
msgstr "Read the Docs 在收集你的个人数据时，提供明确、无歧义且知情同意的方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:330
msgid ""
"We collect only the minimum amount of personal data necessary, unless you "
"choose to provide more. We encourage you to only give us the amount of data "
"you are comfortable sharing."
msgstr "除非你选择提供更多，我们只收集必需的最少个人数据。我们鼓励你只提供自己愿意分享的数据量。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:332
msgid ""
"We offer you simple methods of accessing, correcting, or deleting the data "
"we have collected."
msgstr "我们为你提供简单的方法来访问、更正或删除我们收集的数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:333
msgid "We also provide our users a method of recourse and enforcement."
msgstr "我们还为用户提供申诉和执行途径。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:337
msgid "Resolving complaints"
msgstr "处理投诉"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:339
msgid ""
"If you have concerns about the way Read the Docs is handling your User "
"Personal Information, please let us know immediately by emailing us at "
"privacy@readthedocs.org."
msgstr "若你对 Read the Docs 处理用户个人信息的方式有疑虑，请立即发邮件至 privacy@readthedocs.org 告知我们。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:344
msgid "How we respond to compelled disclosure"
msgstr "我们如何回应强制披露"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:346
msgid ""
"Read the Docs may disclose personally-identifying information or other "
"information we collect about you to law enforcement in response to a valid "
"subpoena, court order, warrant, or similar government order, or when we "
"believe in good faith that disclosure is reasonably necessary to protect our"
" property or rights, or those of third parties or the public at large."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs "
"可能在收到有效的传票、法院命令、搜查令或类似政府命令时，向执法机关披露个人身份识别信息或我们收集的关于你的其他信息；或当我们善意认为披露对保护我们的财产或权利、或第三方或公众的整体利益而言是合理必要时进行披露。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:352
msgid ""
"In complying with court orders and similar legal processes, Read the Docs "
"strives for transparency. When permitted, we will make a reasonable effort "
"to notify users of any disclosure of their information, unless we are "
"prohibited by law or court order from doing so, or in rare, exigent "
"circumstances."
msgstr ""
"在遵守法院命令和类似法律程序的过程中，Read the Docs "
"力求透明。在法律允许的情况下，我们会尽力就任何信息披露通知用户，除非法律或法院命令禁止我们这样做，或在罕见的紧急情形下。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:361
msgid "How you can access and control the information we collect"
msgstr "你如何访问和控制我们收集的信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:363
msgid ""
"If you're already a Read the Docs user, you may access, update, alter, or "
"delete your basic user profile information by `editing your user account "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/edit/>`__."
msgstr ""
"若你已是 Read the Docs 用户，可通过 `编辑用户账户 "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/edit/>`__ 访问、更新、修改或删除你的基本用户资料信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:369
msgid "Data retention and deletion"
msgstr "数据保留与删除"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:371
msgid ""
"Read the Docs will retain User Personal Information for as long as your "
"account is active or as needed to provide you services."
msgstr "只要你的账户处于活跃状态或为向你提供服务所必需，Read the Docs 就会保留用户个人信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:374
msgid ""
"We may retain certain User Personal Information indefinitely, unless you "
"delete it or request its deletion. For example, we don't automatically "
"delete inactive user accounts, so unless you choose to delete your account, "
"we will retain your account information indefinitely."
msgstr "除非你自行删除或要求删除，我们可能无限期保留某些用户个人信息。例如，我们不会自动删除不活跃的账户，因此除非你选择删除账户，我们将无限期保留你的账户信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:380
msgid ""
"If you would like to delete your User Personal Information, you may do so in"
" your `user account <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/delete/>`__. We "
"will retain and use your information as necessary to comply with our legal "
"obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements, but barring legal"
" requirements, we will delete your full profile."
msgstr ""
"若你想删除用户个人信息，可在 `用户账户 <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/delete/>`__ "
"中操作。我们会在履行法律义务、解决争议和执行协议所需的范围内保留和使用你的信息，但除法律要求外，我们将删除你的完整资料。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:386
msgid ""
"Our web server logs for Read the Docs Community, Read the Docs Business, and"
" Documentation Sites are deleted after 10 days barring legal obligations."
msgstr ""
"除法律义务外，Read the Docs Community、Read the Docs Business 和文档站点的 Web 服务器日志会在 10 "
"天后删除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:392
msgid "Changes to our Privacy Policy"
msgstr "隐私政策的变更"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:394
msgid ""
"We reserve the right to revise this Privacy Policy at any time. If we change"
" this Privacy Policy in the future, we will post the revised Privacy Policy "
"and update the \"Effective Date,\" above, to reflect the date of the "
"changes."
msgstr "我们保留随时修订本隐私政策的权利。若今后对本隐私政策作出变更，我们会发布修订后的政策并更新上方的\"生效日期\"以反映变更日期。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:401
msgid "Contacting Read the Docs"
msgstr "联系 Read the Docs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/privacy-policy.rst:403
msgid ""
"Questions regarding Read the Docs' Privacy Policy or information practices "
"should be directed to privacy@readthedocs.org."
msgstr "有关 Read the Docs 隐私政策或信息实践的问题，请发送至 privacy@readthedocs.org。"

